Package: cios-shell
Version: 0.1.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libwayland-client0, libvulkan1
Maintainer: CIOS Project <dev@cios.io>
Description: CIOS Grid Interface - Wayland Shell Overlay
 A futuristic TRON-inspired Wayland shell overlay that provides
 the visual interface for the CIOS operating system. Features
 include the Identity Disc (runtime state indicator), animated
 grid background, and rez-in/derezz transitions.
